# Dance Dance Revolution 4th Mix (G*A33 VER. AAA): a game, from what ddr4m-install.his left (the
# flash and the PC Card installed; the game cassette in): the title is at frame ~6,900. Three coins
# at the title (this version's credit), Start twice; the selects time out to their defaults; the
# song played by stepping on all four panels every 8 frames. Hashes the main RAM every frame,
# snapshots every 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game ddr4m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 7000 press "Coin 1" 8
at 7040 press "Coin 1" 8
at 7080 press "Coin 1" 8
at 7200 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 7400 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 9700 every 8 press "P1 Left" 4
from 9700 every 8 press "P1 Down" 4
from 9700 every 8 press "P1 Up" 4
from 9700 every 8 press "P1 Right" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 18700 quit
